      "p_a_slot": 0.00960900411025374,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.9903909958897463,
      "prose": {
        "text": "Fully remote.\n\nOne reason is that research suggests that fully remote work can lead to increased productivity and output per employee, as it eliminates the distractions and commute time associated with office work.",
